[[7417,2851,"There was no separation between adult and child parts of the platforms or separate platforms for children and adults","lack of platform separation for children",""],[7418,2851,"There was no age verification when signing up to the on-line platform","lack of age verification",""],[7419,2851,"That the content was not controlled so as to be age specific","uncontrolled age-specific content",""],[7420,2851,"That algorithms were used to provide content together with adverts","algorithmic content delivery",""],[7421,2851,"That the parent, guardian or carer did not have access, to the material being viewed or any control over that material","lack of parental control",""],[7422,2851,"That the child's account was not capable of being separately linked to the parent, guardian or carer's account for monitoring","no linked monitoring accounts",""]]